          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pemasangan dilepas di iPhone ini. Tidak dapat menghubungi bisnis untuk konfirmasi; mereka juga bisa mencabutnya dari sisi mereka."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpairing stops Rentro from associating future location updates with this rental unit. Data the business already holds follows its retention policy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Melepas pemasangan menghentikan Rentro mengaitkan pembaruan lokasi berikutnya dengan unit sewa ini. Data yang sudah dimiliki bisnis mengikuti kebijakan retensinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unread": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belum dibaca"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upcoming": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Akan datang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pembaruan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Rentro to run a rental business instead": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pakai Rentro untuk menjalankan bisnis sewa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a dedicated Apple ID for the rental iPhones, never your personal one: whatever that account syncs (Photos, Messages, passwords) is visible to every renter. Turn off every iCloud sync except what Rentro Tracker needs, and wipe each phone between rentals.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gunakan Apple ID khusus untuk iPhone sewaan, jangan Apple ID pribadi: apa pun yang disinkronkan akun itu (Foto, Pesan, kata sandi) terlihat oleh setiap penyewa. Matikan semua sinkronisasi iCloud kecuali yang dibutuhkan Rentro Tracker, dan hapus isi tiap iPhone di antara penyewaan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this when the rental device is being removed or reconfigured. Pairing again needs a new code and a new agreement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gunakan ini saat perangkat sewa dilepas atau dikonfigurasi ulang. Memasangkan lagi memerlukan kode baru dan perjanjian baru."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Values cannot be negative.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nilai tidak boleh negatif."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Versi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tampilan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View Rental": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lihat Sewa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View all": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lihat semua"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View location": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lihat lokasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the owner to share the fleet with this Apple ID.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menunggu pemilik membagikan armada ke Apple ID ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting to upload": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menunggu diunggah"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Rentro stores": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yang disimpan Rentro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is shared": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yang dibagikan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where it lives": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lokasi penyimpanan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While using the app": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saat aplikasi dipakai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anda dapat mengubahnya nanti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You paused sharing. Nothing is being sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anda menjeda berbagi. Tidak ada yang dikirim."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're all caught up": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Semua sudah beres"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline. Try again when you have a connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anda sedang offline. Coba lagi saat tersambung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your control": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kendali Anda"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data is stored on this iPhone. Rentro works offline and does not need an account on a Rentro server. Signing in uses Sign in with Apple only to identify you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data Anda disimpan di iPhone ini. Rentro bekerja offline dan tidak membutuhkan akun di server Rentro. Masuk memakai Masuk dengan Apple hanya untuk mengenali Anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your rental business at a glance": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bisnis sewa Anda sekilas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud isn't set up in this build": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud belum disiapkan di build ini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks for location permission. You can change it in Settings, or stop sharing in this app, at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS meminta izin lokasi. Anda dapat mengubahnya di Pengaturan, atau berhenti berbagi di aplikasi ini, kapan saja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS may delay or pause location in the background to save battery. Contact the rental business if this iPhone keeps showing no recent signal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS dapat menunda atau menjeda lokasi di latar belakang untuk menghemat baterai. Hubungi bisnis sewa jika iPhone ini terus menunjukkan tidak ada sinyal terbaru."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 15 Pro": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 15 Pro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
